#: ../../../syntax-hard.rst:32
msgid ""
"Floats are IEEE-754 binary approximations, so neither ``0.1`` nor ``0.2`` is"
" exact. Their sum rounds to a value slightly above ``0.3``, which ``repr`` "
"shows as ``0.30000000000000004``."
msgstr ""
"Los flotantes son aproximaciones binarias IEEE-754, así que ni ``0.1`` ni "
"``0.2`` son exactos. Su suma se redondea a un valor ligeramente superior a "
"``0.3``, que ``repr`` muestra como ``0.30000000000000004``."

#: ../../../syntax-hard.rst:37 ../../../syntax-hard.rst:119
#: ../../../syntax-hard.rst:207 ../../../syntax-hard.rst:291
#: ../../../syntax-hard.rst:373 ../../../syntax-hard.rst:457
