msgid "``ValueError``"
msgstr "``ValueError``"

#: ../../../syntax-hard.rst:58
msgid ""
"Because ``0.1 + 0.2`` produces ``0.30000000000000004`` rather than exactly "
"``0.3``, the equality is ``False``. This is why floats should be compared "
"with a tolerance, e.g. ``math.isclose``."
msgstr ""
"Como ``0.1 + 0.2`` produce ``0.30000000000000004`` en lugar de exactamente "
"``0.3``, la igualdad es ``False``. Por eso los flotantes deben compararse "
"con una tolerancia, p. ej. ``math.isclose``."

